From 437c59f0874fd1bf73d4f2717087c40d313348e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Damir=20Jeli=C4=87?= <poljar@termina.org.uk>
Date: Wed, 13 Nov 2019 17:05:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/32] electron-main: Check for seshat existence instead of
 erroring out.

